        <div class="uSg02">
<div class="DrnCK">
<div class="HwXOf">
<div class="kcAOr t9ThB" data-testid="RecipientWell">
<div data-tabster="{&quot;mover&quot;:{&quot;cyclic&quot;:false,&quot;direction&quot;:2,&quot;memorizeCurrent&quot;:false}}">
<div id="MSG_gAATtIvrAAA_TO" class="___sj378o0 fly5x3f f1l02sjl f113hnb5" role="heading" aria-level="3">
<h2 id="28" class="EditorClass ___18acxwi ftgm304 fr7e4de f1ids18y f1ohdurq f1fa7rqs f10pi13n f1a3p1vp fkhj508 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv fly5x3f f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f f19f4twv f1tyq0we fz5stix g7toD" tabindex="-1" role="presentation" aria-multiline="true" aria-readonly="true" aria-label="To: Andrew Cary">Symbols of American Innovation on Display</h2>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div data-test-id="mailMessageBodyContainer">
<div class="XbIp4 jmmB7 customScrollBar GNqVo allowTextSelection">
<div id="UniqueMessageBody_12" class="OuGoX BIZfh" tabindex="0" role="document" aria-label="Message body" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="false" data-fui-focus-visible="">
<div dir="ltr">
<p>Celebrate the USA&#8217;s 250th anniversary with symbolic artifacts reflecting Silicon Valley’s inventive spirit: an ASCII art American flag newly created on the historic IBM 1401 and a replica of Gordon Moore’s Fairchild patent notebook.</p>
<a href="https://computerhistory.org/chm-celebrates-the-u-s-a-250/" class="button button--secondary">Explore</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

