            <div class="intro__column-right column-small">
        <p><strong>MUSEUM HOURS</strong></p>
<p><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559738&quot;:40,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">Monday and Tuesday: Closed<br />
Wednesday–Sunday<br />
10 a.m.–5 p.m. <br />
<a href="https://computerhistory.org/hours-admission/">Holidays and Closures</a></p>
<p>
</span></p>

